	<meta name="description" content="The Akvárium Klub is a community space and cultural-artistic meeting place located in the heart of Budapest, at Erzsébet Square. There are 3 large rooms in the area, with a capacity of several thousand people. It is suitable for standing receptions, seated events, concerts, and corporate parties." />
